{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48300","headline":"桂州筵上赠胡予女 · 陆岩梦","name":"桂州筵上赠胡予女","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自道风流不可攀，却堪蹙额更颓颜。\n眼睛深却湘江水，鼻孔高於华岳山。\n舞态固难居掌上，歌声应不绕梁间。\n孟阳死後欲千载，犹在佳人觅往还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆岩梦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}